  "_comment2": "reset_vars: Elementor global variables defined by the SHOP kit but not by the root kit (src/assets/css/elementor/post-45.css); reset on the chrome wrapper so shop-only values never leak into the header/footer. Regenerate from the shop kit CSS if the shop kit gains new globals. --e-global-typography-primary-font-family is also reset on purpose: the shop kit styles .elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title with it (root kit has no such rule), which turned heading text Inter instead of DM Sans."
